um) and reduced flow rate to lower ECD; losses cured after 3.2 hrs.","lesson_learned":"Reduce ECD (lower flow, controlled ROP) when approaching the Alluvium loss zone.","source_doc":"WCR MRN-09","event_date":"2013-01-14","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"MRN-09 · 77 m"},{"id":222,"well_id":"MRN-09","depth_m":942.0,"formation":"Dhekiajuli","event_type":"Wellbore Instability","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":10.0,"mud_weight_ppg":9.2,"description":"Shale instability at 942 m MD in Dhekiajuli; 112 bbl of cavings circulated out over 24 hrs.","mitigation":"Raised MW by 0.3 ppg, minimised open-hole time and controlled tripping speeds.","lesson_learned":"Minimise open-hole time in Dhekiajuli; shale destabilises within days.","source_doc":"DDR MRN-09 · 2013-02-24","event_date":"2013-02-24","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"MRN-09 · 942 m"},{"id":223,"well_id":"MRN-09","depth_m":2876.0,"formation":"Barail","event_type":"Torque Spike","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":5.5,"mud_weight_ppg":10.7,"description":"Torque increased sharply from 11.3 to 20.2 kft-lb at 2,876 m MD while drilling Barail; ROP dropped and stick-slip observed.","mitigation":"Pulled to shoe, changed to a stabilised BHA and resumed drilling at controlled parameters.","lesson_learned":"Expect torque increase in Barail coal seams; pre-empt with lubricant and a stabilised BHA.","source_doc":"DDR MRN-09 · 2013-06-17","event_date":"2013-06-17","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"MRN-09 · 2,876 m"},{"id":224,"well_id":"MRN-09","depth_m":2957.0,"formation":"Barail","event_type":"Fishing","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":19.2,"mud_weight_ppg":10.8,"description":"BHA parted at connection while drilling Barail at 2,957 m MD; overshot run to recover.","mitigation":"Ran overshot and recovered fish after 4.2 hrs; inspected BHA components.","lesson_learned":"Keep fishing tools on location when drilling Barail.","source_doc":"DDR MRN-09 